@prefix swperson: <http://data.semanticweb.org/person/>.
@prefix wiki: <http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/>.
@prefix sioc: <http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#>.
@prefix swrc: <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#>.
